  vendorName: Heiress Belmont
  offerText: My family simply has too much wealth. I am handing out stacks of cash
    to citizens. Take this envelope. There is absolutely no catch.
  acceptResultText: You take the money, nervously waiting for the trap... but it
    never comes. She smiles and walks away. You are simply richer and delighted!
  rejectResultText: You angrily tell her you don't fall for obvious scams. A minute
    later, you watch her hand the envelope to your neighbor. The crushing regret
    ruins your day.
